uk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"Pufferfish","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Pufferfish in the water","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"Pangolin sitting on grass","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"Curled up pangolin","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Chameleon","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"Green chameleon","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":13,"title":"The grey porcupine","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":14,"title":"Angry porcupine walking on the green grass","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":15,"title":"Octopus","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":16,"title":"Dark ink spreading in the water","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":17,"title":"animals and plants","illustrator":"Kingshuk Chaudhary","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲಿ ನೋಡಿ! ನಾನೆಷ್ಟು ಚುರುಕು ಗೊತ್ತಾ!"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಬಾಲ ಹಿಡಿಯಿರಿ ನೋಡೋಣ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆ...ಆ! ಅಯ್ಯೋ!"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ನನ್ನ ಎಲೆ ಮುಟ್ಟಬೇಡ.","ನಾನು ಮೋಡಗಳನ್ನು ನೋಡಬೇಕು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ಇದೇನು!"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾನೇನು ಸದಾ ಇಷ್ಟು ಪುಟ್ಟದಲ್ಲ.","ಫುಟ್ಬಾಲ್‍ ಎಂದು ಕೂಗಿ ನೋಡಿ!"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಫಟ್‍!"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ನಾನು ಯಾವುದಕ್ಕೂ ಹೆದರಲ್ಲ! ಸಿಂಹಗಳಿಗೂ. ನೀನು ಎಷ್ಟು ಜೋರಾ...ಗಿ ಘರ್ಜಿಸಿದರೂ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಠೀಂಗ್‍!"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಾಡು ಕೇಳಿದರೆ ನನಗೆ ಒಂಥರಾ ಆಗತ್ತೆ.","ಅದಕ್ಕೆ, ಒಹೋ... ಒಹೋ... ಹ್ಹೋ... ಹೋ... ಎಂದು ಹಾಡಬೇಡ."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಅಗೋ!"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಓಯ್ ನೀನೇ, ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಭಯ","ಹುಟ್ಟಿಸುವ ನಿನ್ನ ಮುಖ ತೋರಿಸು. ನೋಡೋಣ!"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಆಆಆಆ!"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾನು ಸದಾ ಸುಮ್ಮನೇ ಇರಬೇಕು, ಏಕೆಂದು ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ. ಅದಕ್ಕೆ, ಚಕ್ ಅಂತ ಓಡಬೇಡ, ಆಯ್ತಾ?"]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆ...ಆ! ಅಯ್ಯೋ!"]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/79602-a-aa-ayyo/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳನ್ನು ಭೇಟಿ ಮಾಡಿ","ಹಲ್ಲಿ","ಮುಳ್ಳುಹಂದಿ","ಊಸರವಳ್ಳಿ","ಚಿಪ್ಪುಹಂದಿ","ಬುರುಡೆ ಮೀನು","ಅಷ್ಟಪಾದಿ","ಮುಟ್ಟಿದರೆ ಮುನಿ"]}],"wordCount":86}